%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-numbers-functions-fromradixnumber (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import fromRadixNumber from dw::core::Numbers
output application/json
---
{
    a: fromRadixNumber("10", 2),
    b: fromRadixNumber("FF", 16)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": 2,
  "b": 255
}
